  "description": "Building is a 4 storey converted house. Flat 3 is located on the Upper Ground Floor and is a single, one-bedroom flat.\nProposed development is to replace the single-glazed back bedroom and 3 front windows that form a bay window with traditional timber double-glazed sash windows that maintain the same consistent style. Hardware will be replica brass fittings.\n\nThe double-glazed units will be 4mm clear outside/16mm white spacer bar/4mm low E inside, Argon filled, and will have an A+ energy rating\n\nInstaller is FENSA registered",
